# --- Forensic evidence: never commit real case data ---
# Memory images (raw, vmem, dmp, etc.) and anything derived from a
# real investigation must never be committed. Sample/test images
# belong in an external, documented download step -- see README.
*.raw
*.vmem
*.dmp
*.mem
/data/
/images/
/evidence/

# Pipeline outputs (graph JSON, reports) -- regenerate, don't commit
*.graph.json
graph_output.json
reports/

# Secrets
.env
*.key
